        <h1>How to Compress a PDF <em>Without Uploading It</em></h1>
        <p class="dek">Nearly every online PDF compressor sends your file to a server first. Here is how compression actually works, why some PDFs barely shrink, and how to cut file size on your own device with nothing uploaded. The Best Answer Hub PDF Compressor does the whole job in your browser.</p>
