          <li>PDF Association, <a href="https://pdfa.org/resource/iso-32000-2/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ISO 32000-2 (PDF 2.0)</a>, and <a href="https://pdfa.org/understanding-brotli-pdf-compression/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Understanding PDF compression filters</a>.</li>
          <li>Google, <a href="https://web.dev/articles/vitals" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Web Vitals</a>, 2026 (Largest Contentful Paint target of 2.5 seconds).</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-12 pt-6 border-t border-bae-border-light text-sm text-bae-muted">Jump into the tools: <a href="/tools/pdf-compressor/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">PDF Compressor</a>, <a href="/tools/pdf-merger/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">PDF Merger</a>, <a href="/tools/pdf-splitter/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">PDF Splitter</a>, and <a href="/pdf-toolkit/" class="text-bae-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-bae-primary transition-colors">the PDF Toolkit</a>.</p>
